          "/Subtype": "/Square",
          "/Rect": "[532, 636.89, 594, 660.89]",
          "/Contents": "(2.4) 仅 CD：固定空间点的真实导数为零和区间常值；初始零兼容推出全时段兼容。u,q的积分构造、函数空间尚未形式化。\n\n模块：LeanPML/PML/TimeInvariants.lean\n定理命名空间：LeanPML.PML\n声明：hasDerivAt_CD_zero; CD_eq_initial; CD_compatibility\n证据：Lean_PML/logs/v0.2.2/ 的实际构建和公理审计。",
          "/T": "Lean 已验证范围（截至 v0.2.2）",
          "/NM": ""
        },
        {
          "/Subtype": "/Square",
          "/Rect": "[532, 615.89, 594, 639.89]",
          "/Contents": "(2.4) 仅 CZ1、CZ2 的真实求导及常值保持，允许 b=0。磁辅助不变量 Cx、Cy 尚未形式化。\n\n模块：LeanPML/PML/TimeInvariants.lean\n定理命名空间：LeanPML.PML\n声明：hasDerivAt_CZ1_zero; hasDerivAt_CZ2_zero; CZ1_eq_initial; CZ2_eq_initial\n证据：Lean_PML/logs/v0.2.2/ 的实际构建和公理审计。",
          "/T": "Lean 已验证范围（截至 v0.2.2）",
          "/NM": ""
        },
        {
          "/Subtype": "/Square",
          "/Rect": "[532, 413.89, 594, 437.89]",
          "/Contents": "(2.5) 仅 Z1=-εbu、Z2=-bq 的固定空间点版本，从初始兼容和原时间方程推出全时段兼容。Qx,Qy重构与完整时域等价未完成。\n\n模块：LeanPML/PML/TimeInvariants.lean\n定理命名空间：LeanPML.PML\n声明：CZ1_compatibility; CZ2_compatibility; Z1_zero_of_zero_absorption; Z2_zero_of_zero_absorption\n证据：Lean_PML/logs/v0.2.2/ 的实际构建和公理审计。",
          "/T": "Lean 已验证范围（截至 v0.2.2）",
          "/NM": ""
        }
