          "/Subtype": "/Square",
          "/Rect": "[534, 130.49, 587, 156.89]",
          "/Contents": "(7.1) 的正吸收分支\na>0 下权重平衡、数值恒等式，以及真实时间 h'=V、l'=V+σⱼh−σᵢl 推出的 Fsp 求导；包含两个方向。\n待完成：h 与真实空间梯度、混合导数交换、可测可积、空间积分、Green/PEC 未实现。\n\nLeanPML.PML.spatial_weight_balance\nLeanPML.PML.spatial_rate_identity\nLeanPML.PML.hasDerivAt_spatialAuxiliary\nLeanPML.PML.hasDerivAt_spatialEnergy_pos\nLeanPML.PML.hasDerivAt_spatialEnergy2D\n\n当前证据：\nlogs/v0.2.3/20261010T232910_472603_lake_build_retry.log\nlogs/v0.2.3/20261010T232931_121820_axioms_audit_retry.log",
          "/T": "LeanPML v0.2.3 已验证范围",
          "/NM": "LeanPML.v0.2.3.spatial-positive"
        },
        {
          "/Subtype": "/Square",
          "/Rect": "[534, 59.49, 587, 85.89]",
          "/Contents": "(7.1) 后零吸收区未编号二维公式\nh 的实际时间导数给出 h²/2 和双分量平方和的导数；接回分支能量时明确需要 l=h，保留 c(hx²+hy²)。\n待完成：p=r=0 不自动给出兼容；完整 PDE 中零辅助量来源、实际梯度及空间积分仍待兑现。\n\nLeanPML.PML.hasDerivAt_zeroSpatialComponent\nLeanPML.PML.hasDerivAt_zeroSpatial2D\nLeanPML.PML.hasDerivAt_spatialEnergy_zero\nLeanPML.PML.zeroSpatial_compatibility_preserved\n\n当前证据：\nlogs/v0.2.3/20261010T232910_472603_lake_build_retry.log\nlogs/v0.2.3/20261010T232931_121820_axioms_audit_retry.log",
          "/T": "LeanPML v0.2.3 已验证范围",
          "/NM": "LeanPML.v0.2.3.spatial-zero"
        }
      ]
